 #      mobeds silent for three days, Zirak's prophecy (Fereydun, his father, the cow Barmayeh), Zahhak falls from his throne and searches
 #      the world; sh3: Fereydun is born to Faranak and Abtin; Abtin, of the royal line and in hiding, is caught by Zahhak's guards)
 ("p5s1a",5,1,"ZIRAK","His name… will be Fereydun.","نامش… فریدون خواهد بود.","His name... will be Fereydoon."),
 ("p5s1b",5,1,"NARRATOR","One dream… and the snake king never slept in peace again.","یک خواب… و شاه ماردوش دیگر هرگز آرام نخوابید.",
  "One dream... and the snake king never slept in peace again."),
 ("p5s3a",5,3,"ARNAVAZ","You are safe, my king. It was only a dream.","در امانی، سرورم. فقط یک خواب بود.",None),
 ("p5s3b",5,3,"ZAHHAK","I saw three warriors… coming out of my palace.","سه جنگجو دیدم… که از کاخم بیرون می‌آمدند.",
  "I saw three warriors... coming out of my palace."),
 ("p5s3c",5,3,"ZAHHAK","The youngest walked in the middle, tall as a cypress.","جوان‌ترینشان در میان می‌آمد، بلندقامت مثل سرو.",None),
 ("p5s3d",5,3,"ZAHHAK","In his hand was a mace… with the head of an ox.","در دستش گرزی بود… با سرِ گاو.","In his hand was a mace... with the head of an ox."),
 ("p5s3e",5,3,"ZAHHAK","He struck me… and tied me up with a rope.","به من ضربه زد… و با طناب مرا بست.","He struck me... and tied me up with a rope."),
 ("p5s3f",5,3,"ZAHHAK","Then he dragged me all the way to Mount Damavand…","بعد مرا کشان‌کشان تا کوه دماوند برد…",
  "Then he dragged me, all the way to Mount Dama-vaand..."),
 ("p5s3g",5,3,"ZAHHAK","…and the people ran after us.","…و مردم پشت سرمان می‌دویدند.","and the people ran after us."),
 ("p5s3h",5,3,"ARNAVAZ","Then call the wise men from every land.","پس خردمندان را از هر سرزمینی فرا بخوان.",None),
 ("p5s3i",5,3,"ARNAVAZ","Ask them who this young man is. Then you can stop him.","از آن‌ها بپرس این جوان کیست. آن‌وقت می‌توانی جلویش را بگیری.",None),
 ("p5s4a",5,4,"NARRATOR","So the king called the wisest men of the land to his palace.","پس شاه داناترین مردانِ سرزمین را به کاخش فرا خواند.",None),
 ("p5s4b",5,4,"ZAHHAK","Tell me what my dream means. Who is this young man?","بگویید خوابم چه معنایی دارد. این جوان کیست؟",None),
 ("p5s4c",5,4,"NARRATOR","But they were afraid. For three days, no one said a word.","اما می‌ترسیدند. سه روز تمام، هیچ‌کس حرفی نزد.",None),
 ("p5s4d",5,4,"ZAHHAK","Enough! Speak today… or I will hang you all!","بس است! همین امروز حرف بزنید… وگرنه همه‌تان را به دار می‌آویزم!",
  "Enough! Speak today... or I will hang you all!"),
 ("p5s5a",5,5,"NARRATOR","Then a wise old man named Zirak stepped forward.","آن‌وقت پیری دانا به نام زیرک پا پیش گذاشت.",
  "Then a wise old man, named Zeerak, stepped forward."),
 ("p5s5b",5,5,"ZIRAK","My king, no one lives forever. Not even you.","سرورم، هیچ‌کس تا ابد زنده نمی‌ماند. حتی تو.",None),
 ("p5s5c",5,5,"ZIRAK","One day, a boy will be born. His name will be Fereydun.","روزی پسری به دنیا می‌آید. نامش فریدون خواهد بود.",
  "One day, a boy will be born. His name will be Fereydoon."),
 ("p5s5d",5,5,"ZIRAK","He is the young man in your dream. He will take your throne.","او همان جوانِ خوابِ توست. او تختت را می‌گیرد.",None),
 ("p5s5e",5,5,"ZAHHAK","Why? What have I done to him?","چرا؟ مگر من با او چه کرده‌ام؟",None),
 ("p5s5f",5,5,"ZIRAK","You will kill his father… and the cow that will feed him.","تو پدرش را می‌کشی… و گاوی را که دایه‌ی او می‌شود.",
  "You will kill his father... and the cow that will feed him."),
 ("p5s5g",5,5,"ZIRAK","And he will come for revenge.","و او برای انتقام می‌آید.",None),
 ("p5s5h",5,5,"NARRATOR","When the king heard this, he fainted and fell from his throne.","شاه وقتی این را شنید، از هوش رفت و از تخت افتاد.",None),
 ("p5s6a",5,6,"ZAHHAK","Find this Fereydun! Search every house!","این فریدون را پیدا کنید! همه‌ی خانه‌ها را بگردید!","Find this Fereydoon! Search every house!"),
 ("p5s6b",5,6,"NARRATOR","From that day, the king had no rest, no sleep, no food.","از آن روز، شاه نه آرام داشت، نه خواب، نه خوراک.",None),
 ("p5s6c",5,6,"NARRATOR","But far away, in a small house, a baby boy was born.","اما دور از آنجا، در خانه‌ای کوچک، پسری به دنیا آمد.",None),
 ("p5s6d",5,6,"ABTIN","Look, Faranak… our son. Fereydun.","نگاه کن، فرانک… پسرمان. فریدون.","Look, Faraanak... our son. Fereydoon."),
 ("p5s6e",5,6,"FARANAK","Shh… sleep now, my little king.","آرام… حالا بخواب، شاهِ کوچکِ من.","Shhh... sleep now... my little king."),
 ("p5s6f",5,6,"NARRATOR","His father, Abtin, came from a family of kings… so he lived in hiding.","پدرش، آبتین، از خاندان شاهان بود… برای همین پنهانی زندگی می‌کرد.",
  "His father, Aabteen, came from a family of kings... so he lived in hiding."),
 ("p5s6g",5,6,"NARRATOR","One evening, on the road home…","یک غروب، در راهِ خانه…","One evening, on the road home..."),
 ("p5s6h",5,6,"GUARD","You there! Stop!","آهای تو! بایست!",None),
 ("p5s6i",5,6,"NARRATOR","That night… Abtin did not come home.","آن شب… آبتین به خانه برنگشت.","That night... Aabteen did not come home."),
 # ---- part 6 · The Cow Barmayeh (Shahnameh, «ضحاک» sh3: Faranak runs to the meadow of the cow Barmayeh, whose hide has a new colour on every
 #      hair like a peacock; the keeper raises the boy on the cow's milk for three years; Zahhak hears of the cow; Faranak takes the boy to a holy
 #      man on Mount Alborz; Zahhak comes to the meadow and the cow is no more (not shown); at sixteen Fereydun comes down: who was my father?)
 ("p6s1a",6,1,"NARRATOR","In a hidden meadow, there lived a cow like no other…","در چمنزاری پنهان، گاوی زندگی می‌کرد که مانندش نبود…",
  "In a hidden meadow, there lived a cow, like no other..."),
 ("p6s1b",6,1,"FARANAK","Please… save my son!","خواهش می‌کنم… پسرم را نجات بده!","Please... save my son!"),
 ("p6s3a",6,3,"NARRATOR","After Abtin was taken, Faranak ran from her home with the baby.","بعد از آنکه آبتین را بردند، فرانک با نوزادش از خانه گریخت.",
  "After Aabteen was taken, Faraanak ran from her home with the baby."),
 ("p6s3b",6,3,"NARRATOR","She ran to a far meadow, where an old keeper guarded a wonderful cow.","به چمنزاری دور دوید، جایی که نگهبانی پیر از گاوی شگفت‌انگیز نگهداری می‌کرد.",None),
 ("p6s3c",6,3,"NARRATOR","Her name was Barmayeh, and her coat shone with the colours of a peacock.","نامش برمایه بود و پوستش به رنگ‌های طاووس می‌درخشید.",
  "Her name was Barmaayeh, and her coat shone, with the colours of a peacock."),
 ("p6s3d",6,3,"FARANAK","Please, good man… take my son.","خواهش می‌کنم، مرد نیک… پسرم را بگیر.","Please, good man... take my son."),
 ("p6s3e",6,3,"FARANAK","Feed him with your cow's milk. Be a father to him.","با شیر گاوت سیرش کن. برایش پدری کن.",None),
 ("p6s3f",6,3,"KEEPER","I will, my lady. I will guard him with my life.","چشم، بانوی من. با جانم از او نگهبانی می‌کنم.",None),
 ("p6s3g",6,3,"FARANAK","His name is Fereydun. Keep him secret.","نامش فریدون است. او را پنهان نگه دار.","His name is Fereydoon. Keep him secret."),
 ("p6s4a",6,4,"NARRATOR","For three years, the wonderful cow fed the little boy.","سه سال، آن گاو شگفت‌انگیز پسرک را شیر داد.",None),
 ("p6s4e",6,4,"KEEPER","Gently, little one. She is like a mother to you.","آرام، کوچولو. او برایت مثل مادر است.",None),
 ("p6s4b",6,4,"NARRATOR","But the snake king had eyes everywhere.","اما شاه ماردوش همه‌جا جاسوس داشت.",None),
 ("p6s4c",6,4,"SPY","My king! In a far meadow, there is a strange cow… and a little boy.","سرورم! در چمنزاری دور، گاوی عجیب هست… و پسری کوچک.",
  "My king! In a far meadow, there is a strange cow... and a little boy."),
 ("p6s4d",6,4,"ZAHHAK","A cow… and a boy? It's him! Bring him to me!","یک گاو… و یک پسر؟ خودش است! بیاوریدش پیش من!","A cow... and a boy? It's him! Bring him to me!"),
 ("p6s5a",6,5,"NARRATOR","But Faranak's heart told her that danger was coming.","اما دلِ فرانک به او گفت که خطر نزدیک است.","But Faraanak's heart told her that danger was coming."),
 ("p6s5b",6,5,"FARANAK","They know about him. I must take him far away.","از او باخبر شده‌اند. باید او را به جای دوری ببرم.",None),
 ("p6s5c",6,5,"KEEPER","Then go, my lady. Go now!","پس برو، بانوی من. همین حالا برو!",None),
 ("p6s5d",6,5,"NARRATOR","She carried the boy up Mount Alborz, to a holy man who lived alone.","پسر را به کوه البرز برد، نزد مردی پاک‌دین که تنها زندگی می‌کرد.",
  "She carried the boy up Mount Al-borz, to a holy man who lived alone."),
 ("p6s5e",6,5,"FARANAK","This is my son, Fereydun. One day, he will be king.","این پسر من است، فریدون. روزی پادشاه خواهد شد.","This is my son, Fereydoon. One day, he will be king."),
 ("p6s5f",6,5,"FARANAK","Please… be a father to him.","خواهش می‌کنم… برایش پدری کن.","Please... be a father to him."),
 ("p6s5g",6,5,"HERMIT","I will. No cold wind will ever touch him.","حتماً. هیچ بادِ سردی به او نخواهد خورد.",None),
 ("p6s6a",6,6,"NARRATOR","Then the snake king came to the meadow, like a storm.","آن‌وقت شاه ماردوش مثل طوفان به چمنزار آمد.",None),
 ("p6s6b",6,6,"NARRATOR","But the boy was gone… and the wonderful cow was never seen again.","اما پسر رفته بود… و آن گاو شگفت‌انگیز را دیگر هیچ‌کس ندید.",
  "But the boy was gone... and the wonderful cow, was never seen again."),
 ("p6s6g",6,6,"NARRATOR","Then, in his anger, he burned Faranak's empty house.","بعد، از خشم، خانه‌ی خالیِ فرانک را به آتش کشید.",
  "Then, in his anger, he burned Faraanak's empty house."),
 ("p6s6c",6,6,"NARRATOR","Sixteen years later, a tall young man came down from Mount Alborz.","شانزده سال بعد، جوانی بلندقامت از کوه البرز پایین آمد.",
  "Sixteen years later, a tall young man came down from Mount Al-borz."),
 ("p6s6d",6,6,"FEREYDUN","Mother… tell me the truth.","مادر… حقیقت را به من بگو.","Mother... tell me the truth."),
 ("p6s6e",6,6,"FEREYDUN","Who was my father?","پدرم که بود؟",None),
 # ---- part 7 · Kaveh the Blacksmith (Shahnameh, «ضحاک» sections 5-6: Faranak's answer, the testimonial, Kaveh, the apron on the spear)
 ("p7s1a",7,1,"KAVEH","I will never sign your lies!","من هرگز پای دروغ‌هایت را امضا نمی‌کنم!",None),
 ("p7s1b",7,1,"NARRATOR","One man said no… to the snake king.","یک مرد… به شاه ماردوش «نه» گفت.","One man said no... to the snake king."),
 ("p7s3a",7,3,"NARRATOR","Faranak told her son the whole story.","فرانک همه‌ی ماجرا را برای پسرش گفت.","Faraanak told her son the whole story."),
 ("p7s3b",7,3,"FARANAK","Your father was Abtin. A wise and gentle man…","پدرت آبتین بود. مردی دانا و مهربان…","Your father was Ab-teen. A wise and gentle man..."),
 ("p7s3c",7,3,"FARANAK","…from the family of the old kings of Iran.","…از نژاد پادشاهان کهن ایران.","from the family of the old kings of Iran."),
 ("p7s3d",7,3,"FARANAK","Zahhak's men took him away… and he never came back.","مردان ضحاک او را بردند… و دیگر هرگز برنگشت.",
  "Zah-hawk's men took him away... and he never came back."),
 ("p7s3e",7,3,"FARANAK","Then he came for the cow that fed you… and burned our home.","بعد سراغ گاوی آمد که به تو شیر داده بود… و خانه‌مان را سوزاند.",
  "Then he came for the cow that fed you... and burned our home."),
 ("p7s3f",7,3,"FEREYDUN","Then I'll take a sword and go to his palace. Today!","پس شمشیر برمی‌دارم و به کاخش می‌روم. همین امروز!",None),
 ("p7s3g",7,3,"FARANAK","No, my son! He has a hundred thousand soldiers.","نه، پسرم! او صد هزار سرباز دارد.",None),
 ("p7s3h",7,3,"FARANAK","You are alone. Be patient… your day will come.","تو تنهایی. صبور باش… روزِ تو هم می‌رسد.","You are alone. Be patient... your day will come."),
 ("p7s3i",7,3,"FEREYDUN","I will wait… but not forever.","صبر می‌کنم… اما نه برای همیشه.","I will wait... but not forever."),
 ("p7s4a",7,4,"NARRATOR","In his palace, Zahhak could not sleep.","در کاخش، ضحاک خواب نداشت.","In his palace, Zah-hawk could not sleep."),
 ("p7s4b",7,4,"ZAHHAK_W","Fereydun… Fereydun…","فریدون… فریدون…","Fereydoon... Fereydoon..."),
 ("p7s4c",7,4,"NARRATOR","So he called the great men of every land to his hall.","پس بزرگانِ همه‌ی سرزمین‌ها را به تالارش فراخواند.",None),
 ("p7s4d",7,4,"ZAHHAK","Write that I am a good and just king.","بنویسید که من پادشاهی نیک و دادگرم.",None),
 ("p7s4e",7,4,"ZAHHAK","Then sign it. All of you!","بعد امضایش کنید. همه‌تان!",None),
 ("p7s4f",7,4,"NARRATOR","They were all afraid. So, one by one, they signed.","همه می‌ترسیدند. پس یکی‌یکی امضا کردند.",None),
 ("p7s5a",7,5,"KAVEH","Justice! I want justice!","داد! من داد می‌خواهم!",None),
 ("p7s5b",7,5,"ZAHHAK","Who is shouting at my door? Bring him in!","کیست که جلوی درِ کاخ من فریاد می‌زند؟ بیاوریدش!",None),
 ("p7s5c",7,5,"ZAHHAK","Who has wronged you? Speak!","چه کسی به تو ستم کرده؟ بگو!",None),
 ("p7s5d",7,5,"KAVEH","You have, my king! I am Kaveh, a blacksmith.","تو، ای شاه! من کاوه‌ام، یک آهنگر.","You have, my king! I am Kaa-veh, a blacksmith."),
 ("p7s5e",7,5,"KAVEH","I had eighteen sons. Your snakes took seventeen!","هجده پسر داشتم. مارهای تو هفده‌تایشان را گرفتند!",None),
 ("p7s5f",7,5,"KAVEH","Now your men took my last son. Give him back!","حالا مردانت آخرین پسرم را برده‌اند. او را به من پس بده!",None),
 ("p7s5g",7,5,"ZAHHAK","Bring the boy. Give the blacksmith his son.","پسر را بیاورید. پسرِ آهنگر را به او بدهید.",None),
 ("p7s5h",7,5,"KAVEH_SON","Father!","پدر!",None),
 ("p7s5i",7,5,"ZAHHAK","There. Now, blacksmith… sign my paper.","بفرما. حالا، آهنگر… نامه‌ی مرا امضا کن.","There. Now, blacksmith... sign my paper."),
 ("p7s5j",7,5,"KAVEH","“A good and just king”?","«پادشاهی نیک و دادگر»؟","A good, and just king?"),
 ("p7s5k",7,5,"KAVEH","Shame on you all! You signed his lies because you are afraid!","شرمتان باد! از ترس، دروغ‌هایش را امضا کردید!",None),
 ("p7s5l",7,5,"KAVEH","I will never sign it!","من هرگز امضایش نمی‌کنم!",None),
 ("p7s5m",7,5,"NOBLE","My king… why did you let him go?","سرورم… چرا گذاشتید برود؟","My king... why did you let him go?"),
 ("p7s5n",7,5,"ZAHHAK","When he shouted… it was like a mountain of iron rose between us.","وقتی فریاد زد… انگار کوهی از آهن میان ما برخاست.",
  "When he shouted... it was like a mountain of iron, rose between us."),
 ("p7s6a",7,6,"NARRATOR","In the market, people gathered around the blacksmith.","در بازار، مردم دورِ آهنگر جمع شدند.",None),
 ("p7s6b",7,6,"NARRATOR","He took off his leather apron… and tied it to a spear.","پیش‌بندِ چرمی‌اش را باز کرد… و سرِ نیزه بست.",
  "He took off his leather apron... and tied it to a spear."),
 ("p7s6c",7,6,"KAVEH","Who wants to be free? Follow me!","کی آزادی می‌خواهد؟ دنبالم بیایید!",None),
 # ---- part 8 · The Blacksmith's Banner (Shahnameh, «ضحاک» sections 7-8: Kaveh goes to Fereydun, the apron dressed in Roman brocade, gold
 #      and jewels with red, yellow and violet ribbons, every later king adds jewels; the ox-headed mace drawn in the dust and forged; Fereydun
 #      leaves his mother; the march; Sorush teaches him secret words; the jealous brothers roll a rock at night and he binds it with a spell;
 #      the Arvand (Tigris): the river keeper will not send the boats without Zahhak's seal, "not even a gnat")
 ("p8s1a",8,1,"FEREYDUN","Stop!","بایست!",None),
 ("p8s1b",8,1,"NARRATOR","But who sent that rock… in the middle of the night?","اما چه کسی آن سنگ را… در دلِ شب فرستاده بود؟",
  "But who sent that rock... in the middle of the night?"),
 ("p8s3a",8,3,"NARRATOR","Kaveh marched out of the city, and the people followed him.","کاوه از شهر بیرون رفت و مردم به دنبالش راه افتادند.",
  "Kaa-veh marched out of the city, and the people followed him."),
 ("p8s3b",8,3,"NARRATOR","He knew where to go… to Fereydun.","می‌دانست کجا باید برود… پیش فریدون.","He knew where to go... to Fereydoon."),
 ("p8s3c",8,3,"KAVEH","Fereydun, son of Abtin! The people are with you.","فریدون، پسرِ آبتین! مردم با تو هستند.",
  "Fereydoon, son of Ab-teen! The people are with you."),
 ("p8s3d",8,3,"KAVEH","Lead us against the snake king!","ما را به جنگِ شاهِ ماردوش ببر!",None),
 ("p8s3e",8,3,"FEREYDUN","A blacksmith's apron… on a spear?","پیش‌بندِ یک آهنگر… سرِ نیزه؟","A blacksmith's apron... on a spear?"),
 ("p8s3f",8,3,"FEREYDUN","This is a good sign.","این نشانه‌ی خوبی است.",None),
 ("p8s3g",8,3,"FEREYDUN","Bring silk, gold and jewels! This will be our banner.","ابریشم و طلا و گوهر بیاورید! این درفشِ ما خواهد بود.",None),
 ("p8s3h",8,3,"NARRATOR","He covered it with Roman silk, gold and jewels…","آن را با دیبای رومی، طلا و گوهر آراست…",
  "He covered it with Roman silk, gold, and jewels..."),
 ("p8s3i",8,3,"NARRATOR","…and hung ribbons of red, yellow and violet from it.","…و نوارهایی سرخ و زرد و بنفش از آن آویخت.",
  "and hung ribbons of red, yellow, and violet from it."),
 ("p8s3j",8,3,"NARRATOR","He called it the Kaviani banner: the banner of Kaveh.","نامش را درفشِ کاویانی گذاشت: درفشِ کاوه.",
  "He called it the Kaavi-aani banner. The banner of Kaa-veh."),
 ("p8s3k",8,3,"NARRATOR","And every king after him added new jewels to it.","و هر شاهی که پس از او آمد، گوهرهای تازه‌ای بر آن آویخت.",None),
 ("p8s4a",8,4,"NARRATOR","Fereydun had two older brothers, Kayanush and Purmayeh.","فریدون دو برادرِ بزرگ‌تر داشت: کیانوش و پُرمایه.",
  "Fereydoon had two older brothers, Kayaa-noosh, and Poor-maa-yeh."),
 ("p8s4b",8,4,"FEREYDUN","Brothers, bring me the best blacksmiths. I need a heavy mace.","برادرها، بهترین آهنگرها را بیاورید. یک گرزِ سنگین می‌خواهم.",None),
 ("p8s4c",8,4,"KAYANUSH","Right away, brother.","همین حالا، برادر.",None),
 ("p8s4d",8,4,"NARRATOR","Fereydun drew its shape in the dust.","فریدون شکلش را روی خاک کشید.","Fereydoon drew its shape in the dust."),
 ("p8s4e",8,4,"FEREYDUN","Like this… with the head of an ox.","این‌طوری… با سرِ گاو.","Like this... with the head of an ox."),
